 Kotak Neo's Trade Free Pro plan prices MTF at 9.69% per annum, the lowest flat rate among the brokers compared here, calculated daily on the funded amount only and applied for as long as the position remains open. This rate applies specifically to the Trade Free Pro plan; other Kotak Neo plans carry different MTF pricing, so it's worth confirming which plan you're on before comparing rates across brokers. It’s also important to note that this is a subscription plan, costing ₹249 plus GST per month – thereby eating into your profits. 
 The facility covers more than 1,500 SEBI-approved Group I stocks and ETFs, with funding available up to ₹20 crore for eligible accounts based on collateral value and risk profile. The current MTF offering states leverage of up to 4x. Kotak Neo's applicable delivery brokerage is 0.10%, while the Trade Free Pro plan carries the monthly subscription fee noted above. 
